{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fdf8e8d5c720e80a3e19f01f6c4ef7c2bdd4cac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=x-y^{x-y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1ad33aeaf069ca6ae0a40f4cf7b9188a985624be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/9/4a97ef7c30af9685dce19ab8d33cce58e31ca71d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -14 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"407\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substitute the variables to determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/6/c8636f672478427e3fa9e9742c038b47b061255b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = 2 - (-2)^{2-(-2)}\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/3/3f3c432b5b089bf4c7653c6d76d3f47cc3b5b3e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = 2 - (-2)^4\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/d/16dd8334da6ef4a74c0693cef1e2b49dbe461568.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = 2 - 16\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/4/034b0c570762cc1b7d210c737a483c600e18ffdb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = -14\\]\" width=\"67\" height=\"12\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resou